OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATwo friends who died on mountain ridge
OL,4,Atried calling 999, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey died on Crib y Ddysgl, a ridge
OL,7,Fthat peaks at 1,065m (3,494ft), less
OL,8,Fthan a mile north of Yr Wyddfa's summit
OL,9,Fand linking it to the notoriously
OL,10,Fnarrow ridge of Crib Goch.
OL,12,FThe mountain rescue team said it did
OL,13,Fnot have enough information about the
OL,14,Flocation or nature of the 999 call to
OL,15,Fact immediately.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
